# Route: guide 48 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to 60, 21
# quests, 1.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Darnassus, Hillsbrad Foothills, Tanaris, Thousand Needles, Un'Goro
# Crater): Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's
# Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's Terrace -> Southshore ->
# Darrow Hill -> Gadgetzan -> Lost Rigger Cove -> The Shimmering Flats ->
# Lakkari Tar Pits.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Crushridge Warmongers (504;
# Crushridge Warmonger 39-40); It's Dangerous to Go Alone (3962; Blazerunner
# 56).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199), In
# the Name of the Light (1053), Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865),
# Troll Temper (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447),
# The Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527), The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets
# (4788), The Crone of the Kraul (1101), Gahz'rilla (2770).

